<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_842_2331.JPG" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Den ersamen unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weysen</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Burgermaister</unclear> unnd Rathe der stat Sannd Gallen</orgName>, unnsern lieben unnd gueten freunden, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">empieten</unclear> wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-1187" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rathgebe</unclear>
<lb n="2"/>der stat Augspurg</orgName> unnser freundtlich willig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diennst</unclear> zuvor. Ersam unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weyß</unclear> lieben unnd guet freund, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unns</unclear> haben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beede</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Sebastian</persName> unnd <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Hainrich</unclear></persName> die
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Zaugmaister</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gebrueder</unclear>, <persName resp="#ner">Caspar <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Zueweylers</unclear></persName> unnd <persName resp="#ner">Jacoben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Stauders</unclear></persName> e. w. burger halben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bericht</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gebetten</unclear>, wie <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ab</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Inligunnder</unclear> supplication
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuvernemen</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Diewyl</unclear> wir dann vermerckhen, daß Inen durch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sy</unclear> die supplicanten, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschechner</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürstreckhung</unclear> der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">domals</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernant</unclear>-
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wurtter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">barschat</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zwillich</unclear>, zu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonnderer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhuettung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ires</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorsteenden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gefarlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachtails</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gediennt</unclear>, und hergegen von <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zuewyler</unclear></persName> unnd
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Iren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verwonten</unclear> versprochen worden, Inen von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßem</unclear> gelt so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ine</unclear> vettern den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Zaugmaistern</unclear> gefallen solte, bezallung zuthon, so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">achten</unclear>
<lb n="7"/>wir, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wo</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">yetzt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erzelt</unclear> also, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">so</unclear> der schuld <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Irem</unclear> angeben nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bekantlich</unclear>, nit unbillich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear>, das sie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versprochnen</unclear> und schon
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gefallnen</unclear> gelt der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Zaugmaister</unclear>, so weit das selbig an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Irem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">außstand</unclear> raicht, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bezalung</unclear> nemen. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Derwegen</unclear> wir Inen auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dise</unclear> unnser
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürschrifft</unclear> nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verzeihen</unclear> sollen noch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">künen</unclear>, sonnder Ist <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hierauf</unclear> an e. w. unnser ganntz freündtlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bit</unclear>, sy wollen mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ermelten</unclear>
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beeden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Iren</unclear> burgern <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weitterung</unclear> unnd allerlay <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vergebnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uncosten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuverhuetten</unclear>, dohin handlen unnd sy vermögen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> sie Inen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zaug</unclear>-
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">maister</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angezogen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guet</unclear>, an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Irem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">außstand</unclear>, wie an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ine</unclear> selbs billich, unnd von Inen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuegesagt</unclear> worden gefolgen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>. Das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear> wir
<lb n="12"/>umb E. w. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">In</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gleichem</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mererm</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freundtlich</unclear> unnd willig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuverdienen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">urbutig</unclear> unnd genaigt. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Datum</unclear> den <origDate when="1553-11-23" cert="medium" resp="#ner">23ten Novembris.
<lb n="13"/>anno etc. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Liii</unclear></origDate>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_842_2332.JPG" n="2"/>
<lb n="14"/>Den ersamen unnd weysen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burger=
<lb n="15"/>mayster und Rathe der statt sant
<lb n="16"/>Gallen</orgName>, unsern lieben und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetten</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freünden</unclear>.
</p>
